|     slab-serif member of the Monaspace family.  Xenon's slight slab
|     serifs (subtle but visible at body size) harmonize with Pagella's
|     serif body letters, producing a more cohesive pairing than any of
|     the sans-serif monospaces we've tried (Inconsolata, TGC Cursor,
|     Source Code Pro).
