|     plus three width axes (Regular, SemiWide, Wide) for a total of
|     ~42 instances.  We use SemiBold as the [\bfseries] target -- the
|     same logic as Source Code Pro Semibold: noticeable emphasis without
|     the slab Bold's heaviness.
